<title>FRANCE: Paris airports postal traffic up 4.1 pct in Jan-Aug.</title>
<headline>Paris airports postal traffic up 4.1 pct in Jan-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-August 1996 postal traffic handled at the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly, totalled 84,394 tonnes, an increase of 4.1 percent on the same period last year, Aeroports de Paris figures show.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
